  "invariants": [
    "No filesystem path or archive payload accepted from or returned to JavaScript; native portal grants, regular no-follow file reads, bounded 64KiB IPC chunks.",
    "Export validates target/revision, size, offsets, EOF and LCGROUP1 magic; sync sibling temporary file, persist_noclobber, sync destination directory.",
    "Inspect alone never sends Finish; preview uses actual summary fields and displays explicit manual zero. More recent LCD intent after Inspect makes Finish fail without overwriting it.",
    "Job identity binds ID/device/group/direction. Local pending identity survives reload; mismatched selected device disables Apply.",
    "Cancel waits for owned worker/server cleanup. Accepted Apply/readback cannot be cancelled. Local cleanup wait is bounded; ambiguous results remain Uncertain and retain recovery identity.",
    "Known completed/failed imported sessions release staging; durable receipts remain recoverable after session Release and daemon restart.",
    "Readback never sends Finish. Explicit reapply echoes opaque runtime token and requires current stored content; creates no new settings/profile/receipt commit.",
    "Normal close joins native workers; Prepared close cancels/releases remote staging. Drafts remain unchanged."
  ],
